{"id":274856356959420,"type":"artist","name":"John Hiatt","artist":null,"year":1952,"weight":22,"info":{"tags":["singer-songwriter","blues","rock","americana","Alt-country"],"country":"US","begin":"1952-08-20","kind":"Person","similar":["Lyle Lovett","Steve Earle","Little Village","Rodney Crowell","Steve Earle & The Dukes","Ry Cooder","Bonnie Raitt","James McMurtry","John Mellencamp","Little Feat"],"disambiguation":"guitarist, pianist and singer-songwriter","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/John_Hiatt_op_Halfway_Amsterdam_festival%2C_1994_-_04.jpg?width=500","bio":"John Hiatt, nacido en Indiana, es un compositor y guitarrista citado como una influencia por artistas tales como Bonnie Raitt, The Neville Brothers, Dr. Feelgood e Iggy Pop. Este hombre que comenzó su carrera en 1974 con el disco \"Hangin' Around The Observatory\", ha publicado una docena de álbumes, aunque su apasionada visión del rock y su penetrante e íntima alma country nunca le proporcionaron gran éxito. La crítica, sin embargo, alabó trabajos como \"Bring The Family\" y \"Stolen Moments\"."},"works":[{"id":132598434556295,"type":"album","name":"Slug Line","artist":"John Hiatt","year":1979,"weight":12,"yt":"owr651xJTzU","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":359,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":187469251566977,"type":"album","name":"Riding With the King","artist":"John Hiatt","year":1983,"weight":3,"yt":"Mpv9jbYg4k0","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":215436743643591,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Roots Rock","rank":193,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":105374829955855,"type":"album","name":"Bring the Family","artist":"John Hiatt","year":1987,"weight":5,"yt":"ASRP9fc-_o4","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":103254340346721,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Musi